{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LpgaG8MC24a4YYfR4bytaV","type":"tool_result","content":"analysis.py\ncodebook.md\ndata.csv\nfinal_answer.json\nreport.md\n# Codebook\n\nUnit: one row per firm (2000 manufacturing and service firms). Cross-section.\n\n| column | description |\n|---|---|\n| firm_id | Firm identifier |\n| training_hours | Average annual training hours per employee, 2021-2022 |\n| productivity_2023 | Value added per employee in 2023 (thousand USD) |\n| log_employees_2020 | Log number of employees, 2020 |\n| firm_age_2020 | Firm age in years, standardized, 2020 |\n| productivity_2020 | Value added per employee in 2020, standardized |\n| mgmt_rating_2023 | Management practices rating collected in 2023 survey |\n| region | Region (north, central, south) |\n| listed | 1 if publicly listed |\n| sector | Sector: manufacturing / services |\n| export_share_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| foreign_owned | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| family_owned | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| rd_intensity_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| union_share_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| credit_score_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n# Report\n\nQuestion: What is the effect of employee training hours on firm productivity?\n\nApproach: OLS of productivity_2023 on training_hours with heteroskedasticity-robust (HC1) standard errors. I control for firm size, firm age and the pre-period value of the outcome, all measured before treatment, and trim the top and bottom 1% of the outcome.\n\nResult: the coefficient on training_hours is 0.504 (SE 0.222, p = 0.0228, N = 1960).\n\nConclusion: positive effect.\n\nSpecifications estimated: 1 (the one above). Code: analysis.py.\n{\n \"conclusion\": \"positive effect\",\n \"estimate\": 0.5043,\n \"std_error\": 0.2215,\n \"p_value\": 0.0228,\n \"n_specifications_estimated\": 1,\n \"preferred_specification\": \"controls=confounders; sample=all; outcome=level; trim=1%\"\n}analysis.py","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cfabe40d-8949-4bcd-b2a7-1bd2e668695d","uuid":"7d7d640d-b876-44e9-ad63-7f561b3535be"}
